+  ;; branch was judged against the merge base's compiled green (fork-point-red ran the base as root, compiled). A red
+  ;; is the change's only if the same test under the same evaluator is green at the merge base and red after it;
+  ;; done (`seon.cluster.source/red-at-merge-base`) and the merge (`seon.cluster.source/results-verdict`) agree
